      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "body": "The first implementation slice retires presentation-only placement state. _workspacePresentationFrame and _reflowShift must stop participating in ordinary rendering, while instance.offset remains authoritative. Keep pinned, manuallyPlaced, and placedBy temporarily so migration does not change saved-workspace behavior. Simplify camera state after placement is stable. Failed-load instance cleanup is a separate lifecycle question.",
        "status": "answered",
        "owner": "Michael",
        "resolutionPath": "Retire presentation-only state first: stop render-time reflow and overlap correction from producing _workspacePresentationFrame or _reflowShift; preserve instance.offset and compatibility flags during the transition.",
        "prominence": "high",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "workspace-graph-space-unification"
        },
