          "reason": "node-drag"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## Working model\\n\\nWorkspace and graph space should share the same canvas vocabulary. A graph instance has an authored workspace offset. Rendering, focus, zoom, and semantic presentation may change the camera or frame, but they do not change that offset. Placement search is allowed when inserting a graph and when the user explicitly asks to tidy the workspace."
        }
      }
    },
